{"unit_id":"adbdbb475848ab546f4f","title":"提案二","kind":"proposal","blocks":[{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p2-b18","raw_text":"提案二 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":5,"bbox":[36.0,599.3160400390625,92.0040054321289,615.2760009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p2-b19","raw_text":"案由：有關疱疹藥物使用規範。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":16,"bbox":[36.0,629.3160400390625,267.95001220703125,645.2760009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p2-b20","raw_text":"說明：Acyclovir 400mg、800mg （限Virless, 永信）及200mg（限Deherp,\n","start_char":0,"end_char":55,"bbox":[36.0,659.3160400390625,559.4353637695312,675.2760009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p2-b21","raw_text":"生達）申報與審查共識如下(自108 年6 月1 日起）： \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[36.0,689.3160400390625,420.1600036621094,705.2760009765625]},{"page":2,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p2-b22","raw_text":"一. 帶狀疱疹或水痘：每日最高劑量 4g，療程最長以7 日為上限。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":35,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,719.3160400390625,551.3399658203125,735.2760009765625]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p3-b1","raw_text":"二. 單純疱疹：每日最高劑量 1.2g，療程最長以7 日為上限。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":34,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,47.216041564941406,519.5399780273438,63.17604064941406]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p3-b2","raw_text":"三. 口服藥、外用製劑或注射製劑不得併用。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":23,"bbox":[71.42400360107422,77.23600006103516,399.4000244140625,93.19599914550781]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p3-b3","raw_text":"決議：通過，同說明段，且生殖器疱疹比照單純疱疹使用規範。 \n","start_char":0,"end_char":30,"bbox":[36.0,107.23600006103516,491.9200134277344,123.19599914550781]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p3-b4","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,137.23599243164062,43.97999954223633,153.1959991455078]},{"page":3,"block_id":"MEET-3119b855a344cfb95533-p3-b5","raw_text":" \n","start_char":0,"end_char":2,"bbox":[36.0,167.23599243164062,43.97999954223633,183.1959991455078]}],"source_quality":[]}